  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Existing Development: Use as 5 self contained flats",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any substantive conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the additional five self contained flats located at 19 Wood End Road, Sudbury, Harrow, HA1 3PW,&amp;nbsp; have been in use for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The use as an annexe is therefore immune from enforcement action and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
